<h1>How it works</h1>
<ol class="steps-list">
  <li class="card"><h3>Create your account and pick a career goal</h3><p class="muted">Your goal decides which skills matter most for your roadmap.</p></li>
  <li class="card"><h3>Take an assessment</h3><p class="muted">Answer timed multiple-choice questions mapped to specific skills.</p></li>
  <li class="card"><h3>Review your results</h3><p class="muted">Get an overall score, a skill breakdown and an answer review.</p></li>
  <li class="card"><h3>Generate your roadmap</h3><p class="muted">Skills below target become prioritized steps with learning resources.</p></li>
  <li class="card"><h3>Learn, track and retake</h3><p class="muted">Complete items, earn achievements, then retake to measure improvement.</p></li>
</ol>
